{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_25_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_25","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_25_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_25","textTraditional":"十有四年春正月，公會鄭伯于曹。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_25_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_25","textTraditional":"無冰。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_25_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_25","textTraditional":"夏五，鄭伯使其弟語來盟。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_25_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_25","textTraditional":"秋八月壬申，御廩災。乙亥，嘗。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_25_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_25","textTraditional":"冬十有二月丁巳，齊侯祿父卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_25_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_25","textTraditional":"宋人以齊人、蔡人、衛人、陳人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_25_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_25","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_25_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_25","textTraditional":"十四年春，會于曹。曹人致餼，禮也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_25_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_25","textTraditional":"夏，鄭子人來尋盟，且修曹之會。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_25_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_25","textTraditional":"秋八月壬申，御廩災。乙亥，嘗。書，不害也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_25_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_25","textTraditional":"冬，宋人以諸侯伐鄭，報宋之戰也。焚渠門，入，及大逵。伐東郊，取牛首。以大宮之椽歸為盧門之椽。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}